+published `records/JUDICIARY-REPORT-2026-11-20-cycle-b4d9aed8.md` (landed in
+commit `f4d11f81`). The original report is preserved unchanged; this addendum
+does not rewrite history. No law, ballot, policy, audit machinery, sample,
+outcome or correction trail is changed.
+
+## 1. The error being corrected
+
+The published cycle-`b4d9aed868f6f2f9eebdf38d39e30874` report's own scope line
+names frozen sample `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/oversight/random/latest.json`,
