+`7608821021409001cf`, `3b8b684b346b3b7dcf`) with a different verdict mix (two
+`not_assigned`, one `inconclusive`, one `verified`). Those IDs belong to an
+earlier sample (cycle `b40995`), which has its own report. That table is not the
+frozen sample named by this cycle's token.
+
+### Independent evidence
+
